{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/concepts/mental-model","title":"The mental model","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"the-mental-model","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The mental model"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Three words describe everything "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts"},{"t":"text","text":" does: "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"declare, yield, derive."}]},{"t":"text","text":""}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"You declare state with a name. Every named entity — a factory, a computed, a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"method — pulls in with "},{"t":"code","text":"yield*"},{"t":"text","text":" what it does not own, so the compiler can see"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"that entity's dependencies. Everything else — validity, loading flags, form"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"trees, error unions — is derived rather than restated."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This page is the "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"why"}]},{"t":"text","text":". If you want the "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"how"}]},{"t":"text","text":", the "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn/","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Learn"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"path"}]},{"t":"text","text":" walks the same ideas through a working app."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"declare","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Declare"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"State is declared where it is used, close to the component or service that owns"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"it, with a name that the tooling can see:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"counter"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"state","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'counter'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"0","kind":"number"},{"text":", ({ ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"update"},{"text":" }) ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"increment","kind":"function"},{"text":": () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"update","kind":"function"},{"text":"((","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"value"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" value "},{"text":"+","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"1","kind":"number"},{"text":"),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"}));","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The name isn't a label — it tags the injector ("},{"t":"code","text":"state:counter"},{"t":"text","text":") and is how the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"primitive shows up in logs, snapshots and observability. Five primitives cover"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"every home a value can have: memory, server (read and write), URL, and async"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"action. They share one shape, so learning one teaches the other four — see"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/concepts/primitive-anatomy","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Anatomy of a primitive"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"yield","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Yield"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Classic injection hides the dependency graph. "},{"t":"code","text":"inject(TaskApi)"},{"t":"text","text":" is invisible from"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the outside, so the compiler cannot tell you when a provider is missing, and a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"test cannot tell you what to mock."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Yielding makes the same call visible "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"in the type"}]},{"t":"text","text":" of the entity that yielded"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"it:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"api"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"TaskApi","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A factory that yields "},{"t":"code","text":"TaskApi"},{"t":"text","text":" has "},{"t":"code","text":"TaskApi"},{"t":"text","text":" in its graph. A computed that"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"reads another primitive must yield that primitive too — otherwise the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"dependency is invisible on the computed, even if the surrounding factory"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"already yielded it:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"doneCount"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftUse","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"craftComputed","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'doneCount'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"function*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"return","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"tasks","kind":"function"},{"text":"()).","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"filter","kind":"function"},{"text":"((","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"task"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" task.done).","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"length"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"}));","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"tasks"},{"t":"text","text":" does not belong to "},{"t":"code","text":"doneCount"},{"t":"text","text":". Closing over "},{"t":"code","text":"tasks()"},{"t":"text","text":" would read the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"value and skip the graph. Everything downstream — the route DI check, the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"testing register, the dependency snapshot — reads the type of "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"that"}]},{"t":"text","text":" entity."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"And because you can yield "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"part"}]},{"t":"text","text":" of a service — "},{"t":"code","text":"yield* TaskApi.fetchAll()"},{"t":"text","text":" —"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the graph records only what you actually used, which is what keeps test setups"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"small."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"That is the whole trade: one keyword, in exchange for a dependency graph the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"compiler can check. See "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/concepts/generators","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Generators and "},{"t":"code","text":"yield*"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"derive","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Derive"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The third principle is the one that removes the most code: "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"if a value is a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"function of another value, don't store it — derive it."}]},{"t":"text","text":""}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Derived values are "},{"t":"code","text":"craftComputed"},{"t":"text","text":", inside an insertion, and they "},{"t":"code","text":"yield*"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the readers they depend on."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Loading and error state is derived by the async primitives, not tracked by"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"hand."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A form's field tree, validity and error types are derived from its state and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"its mutation ("},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/forms/","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Forms"}]},{"t":"text","text":")."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Route exceptions are derived into a union the compiler forces you to handle"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"exhaustively ("},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/concepts/exceptions","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Exceptions"}]},{"t":"text","text":")."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The payoff is that derived things cannot drift out of sync with their source."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"The cost is that you have to resist keeping a second copy \"just for the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"template\"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"what-follows-from-this","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What follows from this"}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"composition-instead-of-configuration","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Composition instead of configuration"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Behaviour is added by "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"insertions"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — plain functions that receive a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"primitive's internals and return what to expose. Storage persistence, optimistic"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"updates and forms are all the same shape as one you'd write yourself. Storage"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"persistence uses the backend selected through DI:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"myState"},{"text":" } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"state","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"'myState'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"0","kind":"number"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"insertStoragePersister","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"craftUnique","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    storeName: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'myStore'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    key: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'myState'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  })),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"myQuery"},{"text":" } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"query","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"'myQuery'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"params","kind":"function"},{"text":": () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"1","kind":"number"},{"text":", loader: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"/* … */","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"insertStoragePersister","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"craftUnique","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    storeName: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'myStore'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    key: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'myUserQuery'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  })),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Compose several with the primitive-specific helpers in"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/concepts/insertion-pipes","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Typed insertion pipes"}]},{"t":"text","text":". Keep"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/concepts/insertions","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"craftPipe"}]},{"t":"text","text":" for universal or nested compositions."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"methods-or-events-your-choice","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Methods or events, your choice"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A method can be called directly, or bound to a source and driven by an event."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Both coexist in the same declaration:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"resetSource$"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"source$","kind":"function"},{"text":"<","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"void","kind":"type"},{"text":">(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'resetSource$'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"counter"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"state","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'counter'","kind":"pun